{"fps": 30, "frames": 1731, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 136, "text": "Imagine handing your savings to a man about to lose more than half of it.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 0, "e": 13}, {"w": "handing", "f": 16, "e": 24}, {"w": "your", "f": 26, "e": 27}, {"w": "savings", "f": 31, "e": 42}, {"w": "to", "f": 44, "e": 47}, {"w": "a", "f": 48, "e": 49}, {"w": "man", "f": 51, "e": 58}, {"w": "about", "f": 62, "e": 71}, {"w": "to", "f": 73, "e": 76}, {"w": "lose", "f": 78, "e": 84}, {"w": "more", "f": 87, "e": 89}, {"w": "than", "f": 91, "e": 96}, {"w": "half", "f": 100, "e": 104}, {"w": "of", "f": 107, "e": 109}, {"w": "it.", "f": 111, "e": 116}]}, {"a": 136, "b": 298, "text": "Nineteen sixty-two. Los Angeles lawyer Charlie Munger starts an investment partnership.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 138, "e": 147}, {"w": "sixty-two.", "f": 151, "e": 177}, {"w": "Los", "f": 184, "e": 191}, {"w": "Angeles", "f": 193, "e": 204}, {"w": "lawyer", "f": 207, "e": 213}, {"w": "Charlie", "f": 218, "e": 227}, {"w": "Munger", "f": 229, "e": 240}, {"w": "starts", "f": 242, "e": 249}, {"w": "an", "f": 251, "e": 252}, {"w": "investment", "f": 253, "e": 267}, {"w": "partnership.", "f": 269, "e": 287}]}, {"a": 298, "b": 387, "text": "Eight years, not one losing year.", "words": [{"w": "Eight", "f": 300, "e": 304}, {"w": "years,", "f": 307, "e": 327}, {"w": "not", "f": 329, "e": 336}, {"w": "one", "f": 342, "e": 349}, {"w": "losing", "f": 351, "e": 360}, {"w": "year.", "f": 362, "e": 380}]}, {"a": 387, "b": 517, "text": "Then nineteen seventy-three: down almost thirty-two percent.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 389, "e": 396}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 402, "e": 411}, {"w": "seventy-three:", "f": 413, "e": 444}, {"w": "down", "f": 447, "e": 453}, {"w": "almost", "f": 458, "e": 469}, {"w": "thirty-two", "f": 471, "e": 484}, {"w": "percent.", "f": 489, "e": 518}]}, {"a": 517, "b": 611, "text": "Nineteen seventy-four: down thirty-one more.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 519, "e": 527}, {"w": "seventy-four:", "f": 529, "e": 560}, {"w": "down", "f": 562, "e": 569}, {"w": "thirty-one", "f": 573, "e": 587}, {"w": "more.", "f": 589, "e": 607}]}, {"a": 611, "b": 696, "text": "Your dollar is now worth forty-seven cents.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 613, "e": 616}, {"w": "dollar", "f": 618, "e": 627}, {"w": "is", "f": 629, "e": 631}, {"w": "now", "f": 636, "e": 640}, {"w": "worth", "f": 642, "e": 649}, {"w": "forty-seven", "f": 653, "e": 671}, {"w": "cents.", "f": 676, "e": 692}]}, {"a": 696, "b": 785, "text": "Your buddy Hank cashes out. Told you so!", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 698, "e": 700}, {"w": "buddy", "f": 702, "e": 707}, {"w": "Hank", "f": 709, "e": 718}, {"w": "cashes", "f": 720, "e": 731}, {"w": "out.", "f": 733, "e": 746}, {"w": "Told", "f": 751, "e": 758}, {"w": "you", "f": 760, "e": 762}, {"w": "so!", "f": 764, "e": 773}]}, {"a": 785, "b": 865, "text": "So who's the fool, Hank or Munger?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 787, "e": 789}, {"w": "who's", "f": 791, "e": 796}, {"w": "the", "f": 797, "e": 798}, {"w": "fool,", "f": 800, "e": 818}, {"w": "Hank", "f": 820, "e": 829}, {"w": "or", "f": 833, "e": 836}, {"w": "Munger?", "f": 838, "e": 849}]}, {"a": 865, "b": 971, "text": "Nineteen seventy-five: up seventy-three percent.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 867, "e": 876}, {"w": "seventy-five:", "f": 880, "e": 911}, {"w": "up", "f": 914, "e": 918}, {"w": "seventy-three", "f": 924, "e": 942}, {"w": "percent.", "f": 944, "e": 971}]}, {"a": 971, "b": 1116, "text": "Fourteen years: almost twenty percent a year. The Dow, five.", "words": [{"w": "Fourteen", "f": 973, "e": 987}, {"w": "years:", "f": 991, "e": 1009}, {"w": "almost", "f": 1014, "e": 1020}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 1022, "e": 1029}, {"w": "percent", "f": 1033, "e": 1042}, {"w": "a", "f": 1044, "e": 1047}, {"w": "year.", "f": 1051, "e": 1066}, {"w": "The", "f": 1071, "e": 1073}, {"w": "Dow,", "f": 1076, "e": 1090}, {"w": "five.", "f": 1096, "e": 1112}]}, {"a": 1116, "b": 1187, "text": "A dollar becomes twelve and a half.", "words": [{"w": "A", "f": 1118, "e": 1120}, {"w": "dollar", "f": 1122, "e": 1131}, {"w": "becomes", "f": 1136, "e": 1147}, {"w": "twelve", "f": 1149, "e": 1153}, {"w": "and", "f": 1156, "e": 1158}, {"w": "a", "f": 1159, "e": 1160}, {"w": "half.", "f": 1162, "e": 1180}]}, {"a": 1187, "b": 1274, "text": "You see, it's like leaving a movie at the scary part.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1189, "e": 1191}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1194, "e": 1204}, {"w": "it's", "f": 1207, "e": 1211}, {"w": "like", "f": 1213, "e": 1216}, {"w": "leaving", "f": 1218, "e": 1224}, {"w": "a", "f": 1227, "e": 1229}, {"w": "movie", "f": 1231, "e": 1238}, {"w": "at", "f": 1240, "e": 1242}, {"w": "the", "f": 1243, "e": 1244}, {"w": "scary", "f": 1247, "e": 1256}, {"w": "part.", "f": 1258, "e": 1271}]}, {"a": 1274, "b": 1374, "text": "You paid for the whole film and kept the worst twenty minutes.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1276, "e": 1280}, {"w": "paid", "f": 1282, "e": 1287}, {"w": "for", "f": 1289, "e": 1291}, {"w": "the", "f": 1293, "e": 1296}, {"w": "whole", "f": 1299, "e": 1302}, {"w": "film", "f": 1307, "e": 1316}, {"w": "and", "f": 1318, "e": 1322}, {"w": "kept", "f": 1326, "e": 1329}, {"w": "the", "f": 1330, "e": 1331}, {"w": "worst", "f": 1336, "e": 1342}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 1344, "e": 1351}, {"w": "minutes.", "f": 1353, "e": 1370}]}, {"a": 1374, "b": 1511, "text": "Hank kept forty-seven cents. Those who stayed got the whole ride.", "words": [{"w": "Hank", "f": 1376, "e": 1384}, {"w": "kept", "f": 1389, "e": 1393}, {"w": "forty-seven", "f": 1398, "e": 1413}, {"w": "cents.", "f": 1418, "e": 1438}, {"w": "Those", "f": 1440, "e": 1444}, {"w": "who", "f": 1447, "e": 1449}, {"w": "stayed", "f": 1451, "e": 1462}, {"w": "got", "f": 1467, "e": 1471}, {"w": "the", "f": 1473, "e": 1476}, {"w": "whole", "f": 1478, "e": 1484}, {"w": "ride.", "f": 1487, "e": 1504}]}, {"a": 1511, "b": 1636, "text": "Later, Munger put it bluntly: if you can't stomach a fifty percent drop,", "words": [{"w": "Later,", "f": 1513, "e": 1527}, {"w": "Munger", "f": 1529, "e": 1538}, {"w": "put", "f": 1540, "e": 1542}, {"w": "it", "f": 1544, "e": 1547}, {"w": "bluntly:", "f": 1548, "e": 1560}, {"w": "if", "f": 1571, "e": 1573}, {"w": "you", "f": 1576, "e": 1578}, {"w": "can't", "f": 1580, "e": 1584}, {"w": "stomach", "f": 1587, "e": 1596}, {"w": "a", "f": 1598, "e": 1600}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 1602, "e": 1607}, {"w": "percent", "f": 1609, "e": 1618}, {"w": "drop,", "f": 1620, "e": 1636}]}, {"a": 1636, "b": 1731, "text": "you deserve the mediocre result you're going to get.", "words": [{"w": "you", "f": 1638, "e": 1640}, {"w": "deserve", "f": 1642, "e": 1653}, {"w": "the", "f": 1654, "e": 1656}, {"w": "mediocre", "f": 1660, "e": 1673}, {"w": "result", "f": 1679, "e": 1684}, {"w": "you're", "f": 1687, "e": 1689}, {"w": "going", "f": 1691, "e": 1696}, {"w": "to", "f": 1697, "e": 1698}, {"w": "get.", "f": 1700, "e": 1711}]}]}